[quote]For one hundred years, heaven's hands were tied.[/quote]
[h2]Overview[/h2]
[p]A safety net woven during @[The Great Sacrifice](myth:4433d5c7-1415-4837-afae-3d47c20f8f45): a protective effect across all planes of existence, lasting 100 years from the moment of [b]B[/b]'s shattering. While it held, neither [b]A[/b], [b]C[/b] nor any of the Gods could directly interfere with the planes - and therefore with the development of the mortal races. See @[The Originals](myth:f58d1435-ffc6-429f-9572-bffa739bfc9c).[/p]
[hr]
[h2]Mechanism[/h2]
[p]The shield impedes direct influence from an Original arcane source. The Gods are not outside its reach - they are sub-parts of [b]A[/b] and [b]C[/b], shattered fragments carrying an Original power source, and so the shield binds them by their very nature.[/p]
[hr]
[h2]The Hundred Years[/h2]
[p]After the 100 years, the protection's strength diminished - though it never vanished entirely. The Gods can now interact with and interfere in the planes, though only to a limited degree. Working through the weakened protection, the gods eventually managed to open the planar rifts and execute their invasion plan against the mortal races - the event known as @[The Abominable End](Article:PLACEHOLDER_the_abominable_end).[/p][br]
[p]The effect dwindles progressively. Once completely gone, who knows what effects the Gods could enact upon the Aetris...[/p]